        {
            "@id": "bdr:NTF24F5C4DD8140821",
            "noteText": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "L. v.d. Kuijp has verified that the date of death of the subject was January, 1364. Also the unrecorded teacher Ston tshul may have been Btsun pa Ston tshul, Sa-skya scholar and author of at least two works on Tshad ma."
            },
            "@type": "Note"
        },
